{"2524930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We Escaped a Twisted Game", "steam_appid": 2524930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/d97b79d5287cddd35aa15f7bcf5ee782.avif?t=1768072617\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The horrors awaken.</strong> The gates have opened. The rules are simple: escape… or stay forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/83743c3c357f879d1cedb0fc26a272b5.poster.avif?t=1768072617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/83743c3c357f879d1cedb0fc26a272b5.webm?t=1768072617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/83743c3c357f879d1cedb0fc26a272b5.mp4?t=1768072617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">◈   ◈</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/d042398c37aa2ac93bf7e5503e5ede17.avif?t=1768072617\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Exploring a haunted manor quickly turns into a twisted game of survival. Split apart by walls but connected by voice, you’ll have to rely on each other if you want to see the outside again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/cfea3c04bdbdeebf637f90ec1633a736.poster.avif?t=1768072617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/cfea3c04bdbdeebf637f90ec1633a736.webm?t=1768072617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/cfea3c04bdbdeebf637f90ec1633a736.mp4?t=1768072617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">◈</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">◈</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/015ddee2f01bb82ea31e727fd9432864.avif?t=1768072617\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’ll never see the full picture alone. Half the clues are yours, the rest belong to your partner. Share what you see and guide each other through the unknown… and be careful what else might be listening. Built-in 3D voice chat keeps you connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/17670618c883a0e9281459d7ad718ec3.poster.avif?t=1768072617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/17670618c883a0e9281459d7ad718ec3.webm?t=1768072617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=